(   * The Human Disaster: To a fatigued clinical oncologist, this technical jargon is) Tj
T*
(   uninterpretable gibberish. The doctor assumes the medication was ordered because they clicked) Tj
T*
(   'Submit', when in reality the database transaction failed silently!) Tj
T*
(   * Outcome: The pediatric cancer patient misses critical daily chemotherapy infusions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Aligning with Real-World Clinical Mental Models:) Tj
T*
(   - Physical Medication Parallels: Software should emulate the visual structure of a standardized) Tj
T*
(   physical paper medical MAR \(Medication Administration Record\), showing drug names, dosages,) Tj
T*
(   infusion rates, and route of administration \(IV/Oral\).) Tj
T*
(   - Conversational, Actionable Language: Replace database error codes with plain clinical) Tj
T*
(   explanations: 'Warning: You have entered 500mg. The maximum safe pediatric dose for this) Tj
T*
(   patient's weight is 50mg. Please verify or re-enter dosage.') Tj
T*
() Tj
