/F2 9.5 Tf
45 818 Td
(DESIGN THINKING | UNIT 5: TESTING, VALIDATION AND CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE) Tj
ET
0.75 w
45 806 m 550 806 l S
0.5 w
45 42 m 550 42 l S
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
45 30 Td
(Lovely Professional University | Biotechnology Question Bank & Solutions) Tj
340 0 Td
(Page 16 of 28) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
45 780 Td
(   * Recognition: The cognitive task of identifying whether an external sensory stimulus matches) Tj
T*
(   previously experienced memory chunks \(e.g., seeing a dropdown list containing `-czvf` and) Tj
T*
(   recognizing it as correct\). Recognition is fast, effortless, and computationally cheap for the) Tj
T*
(   brain.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Application to Search Interfaces:) Tj
T*
(   - Blank Text Input Field \(Forced Recall\): Forces the user to generate exact product model) Tj
T*
(   numbers, keywords, and spelling from scratch. If the user misspells 'acetaminophen' as) Tj
T*
(   'acetominophen', search queries fail, inducing user frustration.) Tj
T*
(   - Predictive Dropdown Autocomplete \(Assisted Recognition\): As the user types the first two) Tj
T*
(   letters \(`ac`\), the interface queries a search index and displays visual suggestion chips with) Tj
T*
(   thumbnails and correct spelling.) Tj
T*
(   - Cognitive Impact: The user merely recognizes their desired target from the visual list and) Tj
T*
(   taps it, bypassing working memory strain and eliminating zero-result search failures.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 9:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Examine Nielsen's Seventh Heuristic: 'Flexibility and Efficiency of Use'. How do keyboard accelerators, macros, and customizable interfaces cater to both novice and expert users simultaneously?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Novice-Expert Usability Paradox:) Tj
T*
(   - A software interface must be immediately intuitive, clean, and discoverable for first-time) Tj
T*
(   novice users without overwhelming them with visual complexity.) Tj
T*
(   - However, once users spend hundreds of hours operating the software daily \(expert power) Tj
T*
(   users\), visual menus and multi-click wizards become excruciatingly slow and inefficient) Tj
T*
(   bottlenecks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Dual-Layer Interface Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - Layer 1: Visible, Progressive Gui for Novices:) Tj
T*
(   * Plain-language buttons, clear icons, descriptive tooltips, and linear wizards guide novice) Tj
T*
(   users through unfamiliar workflows with high recognition.) Tj
T*
(   - Layer 2: Invisible Accelerators for Experts:) Tj
T*
(   * Global Keyboard Shortcuts: Binding every major command to muscle-memory keystrokes \(`Cmd+K`,) Tj
T*
(   `Shift+Alt+Down`\).) Tj
T*
(   * Macro Recording & Batch Automation: Allowing power users to script and automate repetitive) Tj
T*
(   10-step workflows into a single one-click macro.) Tj
T*
(   * Configurable Workspace Panes: Allowing power users to customize dockable tool palettes,) Tj
T*
(   display density, and custom shortcut maps.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Outcome:) Tj
T*
(   - Novice users operate the system comfortably with zero training, while expert power users) Tj
T*
(   achieve blinding, 100x operational throughput without leaving the keyboard.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 10:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Deconstruct Nielsen's Eighth Heuristic: 'Aesthetic and Minimalist Design'. Explain the mathematical concept of 'Signal-to-Noise Ratio' in data visualization and dashboard engineering.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Philosophical Principles:) Tj
T*
(   - Every unnecessary visual element, decorative border, redundant label, and unformatted number) Tj
T*
(   competes directly with relevant informational units for human visual attention.) Tj
T*
(   - Minimalism in design is not an artistic lifestyle choice; it is an ergonomic necessity to) Tj
T*
(   preserve human cognitive bandwidth.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
endobj
