(>> Solution to Question 13:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the step-by-step mathematical calculation of the System Usability Scale \(SUS\) score. Work through a complete numerical example for a participant who gave specific Likert scores across all 10 items.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The System Usability Scale \(SUS\) Protocol:) Tj
T*
(   - 10 standardized statements evaluated on a 5-point Likert scale \(1 = Strongly Disagree to 5 =) Tj
T*
(   Strongly Agree\).) Tj
T*
(   - Alternating polarity: Odd items \(1, 3, 5, 7, 9\) are positive statements; Even items \(2, 4, 6,) Tj
T*
(   8, 10\) are negative statements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Numerical Transformation Rules:) Tj
T*
(   - For Odd Items: Adjusted Score = Raw Score - 1 \(yields 0 to 4\).) Tj
T*
(   - For Even Items: Adjusted Score = 5 - Raw Score \(yields 0 to 4\).) Tj
T*
(   - Sum all 10 adjusted scores \(maximum possible sum = 40\).) Tj
T*
(   - Multiply the total sum by 2.5 to normalize onto a 0 to 100 scale.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Complete Numerical Calculation Example:) Tj
T*
(   - Participant Raw Scores across Items 1 to 10:) Tj
T*
(   * Item 1 \(Positive\): 4 -> Adjusted = 4 - 1 = 3) Tj
T*
(   * Item 2 \(Negative\): 2 -> Adjusted = 5 - 2 = 3) Tj
T*
(   * Item 3 \(Positive\): 5 -> Adjusted = 5 - 1 = 4) Tj
T*
(   * Item 4 \(Negative\): 1 -> Adjusted = 5 - 1 = 4) Tj
T*
(   * Item 5 \(Positive\): 4 -> Adjusted = 4 - 1 = 3) Tj
T*
(   * Item 6 \(Negative\): 2 -> Adjusted = 5 - 2 = 3) Tj
T*
(   * Item 7 \(Positive\): 5 -> Adjusted = 5 - 1 = 4) Tj
T*
(   * Item 8 \(Negative\): 2 -> Adjusted = 5 - 2 = 3) Tj
T*
(   * Item 9 \(Positive\): 4 -> Adjusted = 4 - 1 = 3) Tj
T*
(   * Item 10 \(Negative\): 1 -> Adjusted = 5 - 1 = 4) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Summation and Normalization:) Tj
T*
(   - Sum of Adjusted Scores = 3 + 3 + 4 + 4 + 3 + 3 + 4 + 3 + 3 + 4 = 34.) Tj
T*
(   - Final SUS Score = 34 * 2.5 = 85.0.) Tj
T*
(   - Interpretation: A score of 85.0 falls in the 95th percentile, earning an 'Excellent / Grade) Tj
T*
(   A' rating, far above the industry benchmark average of 68.0.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
