(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze how 'Accessible Focus Management' must be engineered in Single-Page Applications \(SPAs\) during modal dialog popups and dynamic page navigation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Single-Page Application \(SPA\) Accessibility Crisis:) Tj
T*
(   - In traditional multi-page websites, clicking a link triggers a full browser reload,) Tj
T*
(   automatically resetting screen-reader virtual cursor focus to the top `<h1>` of the new page.) Tj
T*
(   - SPAs \(React, Vue, Angular\) dynamically rewrite the DOM tree without reloading. If an engineer) Tj
T*
(   opens a modal or navigates to a new view, keyboard and screen-reader focus remains stranded in) Tj
T*
(   arbitrary background nodes, creating total disorientation.) Tj
T*
ET

